    "text": {
     "en": "A panchayat is the local government of a village. The head is the sarpanch and members are elected by the people in the gram sabha.\nThe panchayat looks after roads, wells, schools, street lights and sanitation. It collects some local taxes.\nThe three levels are the Gram Panchayat, the Block Panchayat and the District Panchayat."
    }
